    { q: 'Is a study planner app free?', a: `Many are. ${SITE.app}'s timetable, homework, exam countdowns, grades, habits and reminders are free, plus ${SITE.free.aiMessages} AI messages a month, ${SITE.free.timetableScans} AI timetable scans and ${SITE.free.learningPlans} AI learning plans. ClassTrack Pro removes the AI limits. See <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a>.` },
