    { q: 'Does ClassTrack work on iPhone?', a: `${SITE.app} is on Android now through Google Play. The iPhone version is coming soon; you can join the waitlist on our home page. All the free tools on studyplanner.tech work in any browser, including Safari on iPhone.` },
